// OEM codes: i20 = "did not drain properly", i40 = "clogged filter or sump" (owner.frigidaire.com).
// HONEST FRAME: many Frigidaire models show NO drain code — same fix path. i30 = LEAK not drain
// (do NOT present as drain). Excluded: iF0 (secondary), iC0 (unverified). Glass-trap filter:
// model-dependent — some non-removable, clean in place, do NOT disassemble. CA air-gap check.
// Safe DIY = filter/glass-trap-in-place/hose/disposal knockout/air gap; drain pump = tech. $89.

