  eyebrow="Frigidaire Dishwasher Not Draining · i20 / i40 · Same Day Southern California"
  title="Frigidaire Dishwasher Not Draining: Causes and Fix"
  subtitle="Standing water in a Frigidaire, or an i20/i40 code (or no code at all), is usually the glass trap, hose, disposal, or air gap. Here's the order to check."
  heroImageTitle="Frigidaire Dishwasher Not Draining"
